# Frontend settings.
#
# VITE_API_URL = where the browser reaches the backend.
#   /api  (recommended) - requests go through the frontend and are forwarded to the backend.
#                         Works on every address (public IP, VPN IP, host name), no CORS needed.
#                         `npm run dev` forwards /api to http://localhost:9022 as well.
#   http://<server>:9022 - call the backend directly; then list the frontend address(es) in
#                         CORS_ORIGINS in backend/.env.
# After changing it, rebuild the frontend: docker compose up -d --build frontend
VITE_API_URL=/api
